-       ```tabular
+       ```tabular

-       column  Case
-       column  PDF object
-       column  Notes
-       row  `Nil`  the `null` object  a dictionary entry whose value is `Nil` is equivalent to an absent key, which `apply` honours
-       row  `Truth(value)`  a boolean
-       row  `Integral(value)`  an integer  as `Long`
-       row  `Real(value)`  a real number  as `Double`; `double` reads either numeric type, and the distinction is kept for writing
-       row  `Name(text)`  a name, such as `/Type`  without its slash
-       row  `Chars(bytes)`  a string  as its raw bytes; interpreting them (PDFDocEncoding, UTF-16, dates) is deferred to `text` and to the typed layer
-       row  `Sequence(elements)`  an array
-       row  `Dictionary(entries)`  a dictionary
-       row  `Body(entries, start)`  a stream  a *locator*: its dictionary and the file offset of its raw payload, which is read only through `Pdf#payload` or `Pdf#spring`; a stream made by `newStream` has a negative `start`, keying its bytes in the write overlay
-       row  `Ref(number, generation)`  an indirect reference  resolved by `Pdf#apply` or `Pdf#resolved`
